## 2. Request Flow (Sequence Diagram)

```mermaid
sequenceDiagram
    participant User
    participant Route53
    participant ALB
    participant ECS
    participant Secrets
    participant RDS

    User->>Route53: HTTPS Request (api.domain.com)
    Route53->>ALB: DNS Resolution
    ALB->>ALB: Health Check
    ALB->>ECS: Forward to Healthy Task
    ECS->>Secrets: Get DB Password
    Secrets-->>ECS: Return Credentials
    ECS->>RDS: Execute Query
    RDS-->>ECS: Return Data
    ECS-->>ALB: JSON Response
    ALB-->>Route53: Response
    Route53-->>User: HTTPS Response
```

