## 3. CI/CD Pipeline

```mermaid
graph LR
    A[👨‍💻 Developer] -->|git push| B[📦 GitHub]
    B -->|webhook| C[⚙️ GitHub Actions]
    C -->|npm test| D{Tests Pass?}
    D -->|✅ Yes| E[🐳 Build Docker]
    D -->|❌ No| F[🚫 Fail Build]
    E -->|docker push| G[📦 ECR]
    G -->|trigger| H[🚀 ECS Deploy]
    H -->|rolling update| I[🔄 New Tasks]
    I -->|register| J[🎯 ALB Target]
    J -->|health check| K{Healthy?}
    K -->|✅ Yes| L[✨ Live Traffic]
    K -->|❌ No| M[🔙 Rollback]
    
    style A fill:#e1f5ff
    style L fill:#90EE90
    style F fill:#FFB6C1
    style M fill:#FFB6C1
```

