## 6. Auto-Scaling Logic

```mermaid
graph LR
    A[CloudWatch Metrics] --> B{CPU > 70%?}
    A --> C{Memory > 80%?}
    B -->|Yes| D[Scale Out]
    C -->|Yes| D
    B -->|No| E{CPU < 30%?}
    C -->|No| F{Memory < 40%?}
    E -->|Yes| G[Scale In]
    F -->|Yes| G
    D --> H[Add Tasks]
    G --> I[Remove Tasks]
    H --> J[Update Target Group]
    I --> J
    J --> K[ALB Distributes Traffic]
    
    style D fill:#90EE90
    style G fill:#FFB6C1
    style K fill:#87CEEB
```

